# Who owns the files that decide how the agent behaves.
#
# This is documentation, not enforcement. Requiring a CODEOWNERS review would
# deadlock a single-maintainer repository — GitHub does not let you approve your
# own pull request — so nothing here blocks a merge. What blocks is the
# "Agent behaviour review" step in CI, and only when a guard gets weaker.
#
# The value of this file is that the list exists in one place and a reviewer can
# see, from the PR's file list alone, that a change reaches past the game.

/.claude/                   @delaemon
/CLAUDE.md                  @delaemon
/scripts/                   @delaemon
/.github/                   @delaemon
/.devcontainer/             @delaemon
/docs/worklog/CONTRACT.md   @delaemon
